# ── PrismaMRI environment configuration ─────────────────────────────────────
#
# Currently focused on local connection only.
# Claude Desktop connects directly to the app via the MCP extension on
# 127.0.0.1 — no relay, no server-side config needed.

# ── Future: Cloudflare relay (remote web-app mode) ──────────────────────────
#
# A Cloudflare Worker relay was prototyped to allow non-PWA browser sessions
# to connect to Claude Desktop via a shared WebSocket bridge. Decided to focus
# on local connection first as it covers the primary use case without any
# server infrastructure. May revisit this when remote access becomes a priority.
#
# VITE_RELAY_URL=https://<your-worker-name>.<your-account>.workers.dev
